---
import Sub from "../layouts/Sub.astro";
import { media } from "../lib/media";

const photo = media("about/arian.jpg");
const video = media("about/arian.mp4");
---

<Sub
  title="About"
  description="I break and engage with performing arts. A naši speaker from Istria, based in Copenhagen."
  backText="back at last"
>
  <div class="view">
    <div class="about-wrap">
      <video
        class="about-img"
        src={video}
        poster={photo}
        width="1280"
        height="2276"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        controls
        data-about-video
        aria-label="Arian Šajina"
      ></video>
      <div class="txt about-text">
        <p>
          If I was born a century ago, I’d be a member of the intelligentsia. Two, and I’d be a
          priest. I think this is what I and someone I admire have in common. Anytime before that,
          I’d toil the hoe. Today, I toil the keyboard. I’m a naši speaker from Istria, a Balkan
          émigré, a German immigré, a Yugofuturist(?!), dancer and other based in Copenhagen.
        </p>
        <p>
          I break and engage with performing arts. As a performer, I nurture a lasting creative
          partnership with choreographer Nika Janković Disney. In 2026, I started developing my own
          practice centred around 30 rounds. I created and maintain{" "}
          <a href="http://pleskal.dk">pleskal.dk</a>, an aggregated and crowdsourced public calendar
          for performance art happenings in Copenhagen.
        </p>
        <p>
          Elsewhere, I develop the end-of-day risk engine at Nordea, and have previously worked on
          individual-based modelling of life history evolution at the Valenzano lab. I studied
          Mathematics at University of Bonn and Computer Science at ITU Copenhagen.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am interested in: breaking, dance and choreography, the dance floor as an ‘other’ space
          in the tradition of David Mancuso, forming bonds that last, speaking of home over
          transparent drinks, how to live a good life in a society intent on perpetuating harm,
          islands.
        </p>
        <p>If you wish to conspire with me, reach out.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Sub>

<script>
  import "../scripts/about-video";
</script>

<style>
  .about-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 40em;
  }
  .about-img {
    order: 2;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: block;
    width: 300px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .about-text {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    font-size: clamp(13px, calc(1.6vh + 2px), 17px);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .about-text p {
    margin: 0 0 1em;
  }
  .about-text p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
  }
  /* Desktop: text on the left, video on the right, both inside one screen. The video
     is portrait, so its height (not width) is what is capped to the viewport. */
  @media (min-width: 761px) {
    .about-wrap {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 56px;
      max-width: 62em;
    }
    .about-text {
      flex: 1 1 0;
      max-width: 36em;
    }
    .about-img {
      width: auto;
      height: min(calc(100vh - 210px), 640px);
      max-width: 40%;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-wrap {
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .about-img {
      width: min(100%, 360px);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  }
</style>
